  - DontClose has been renamed _MF_DONT_CLOSE_.

  - Skip has been renamed _MF_SKIP_.

  - Divide has been renamed _MF_DIVIDE_.

  - _MF_ENABLED_ is a new flag value that instructs the editor to enable
